The departures, lines, stops, levels of service and traffic messages come from
the open data of Mobilités M, the mobility service of the Grenoble area
(SMMAG, Syndicat Mixte des Mobilités de l'Aire Grenobloise), published on
https://data.mobilites-m.fr under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Source: Mobilités M (SMMAG).
The widgets show the source (Mobilités M) and the time of each reading. The
files under test/fixtures are extracts of these data, kept under the same
licence.

